Z||000000||Dan87GT||10-03-2001||07:41 AM||||I am reinstalling the vacuum lines on my 86SE there are 2 vacuum lines that connect to the regulator(Left side looking at the front of the engine), I believe one goes to the EGR, does it matter which one goes were? Are both ports the same?||||reg||1
Z||000001||Alex4mula||10-03-2001||08:53 AM||||If they are the ones I think it does matter. One goes to the EGR (I think the thick one) and the other goes to the TBS. One gets the vacuum and the other provides the vacuum. So they are not interchangeable.||||reg||1
